  "description": "Having helped define the hugely popular vape devices known as Pod Mods, Voopoo have redefined their bestselling Drag range of box mods into a sleek new Pod Mod form, one that boasts all the same power and functionality with innovative ergonomics and a host of advanced features. The Drag X Pod Mod is finished with high-quality materials that include smooth alloy and comfortably soft leather that makes the Drag X feel great in the hand. These materials give the Drag X a rugged yet elegant look, refined further by the smooth curves of the magnetically fixed pod on top. The Drag X also shines inside. Voopoo have deployed their most advanced chipset yet, the Gene TT chip, which enables all sorts of intelligent features including smart coil recognition, super-fast 0.001 second firing, puff counter, Smart switch start mode and a never-seen-before score ranking which grades each puff from ‘iron’ to ‘king’. The Drag X can be vaped either by pressing the fire button, or auto-draw just as you would a cigarette. The Voopoo Drag X features Voopoo’s new infinite airflow system and one of the best we’ve seen on devices like this, enabling you to find your perfect draw by smoothly sliding the switch to your preferred position. Coupled with the precision-engineered pods and compatibly with all of Voopoo’s industry-leading PNP coil range, the Drag X provides almost limitless options to tailor your vape exactly how you like it. And if all of that wasn’t enough, the Drag X has the power to last all day and far beyond. An interchangeable 18650 battery can be swapped out at will and can output between 1-80w for incredible clouds and flavour. Compatible with all VooPoo PnP Coils Browse our vape juice and choose the ideal match for this kit. NB: Batteries must be purchased separately - this setup requires 1 x 18650.",
